### Contoh request Tahap 1 (Sites, Categories, Inventories)
### Setelah migrasi 003: inventories = barang per site (site_id, sku, quantity).
### Bisa dijalankan langsung di VS Code dengan extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client):
### klik "Send Request" di atas tiap request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050/api

### 1. Login sebagai admin (salin "token" dari respons ke variabel di bawah)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

###
@token = TEMPEL_TOKEN_DI_SINI

### ---------- SITES ----------
### (5 site utama sudah dibuat oleh `npm run seed`)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Site Contoh", "code": "CTH" }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gunung Megang", "code": "GMG" }

### ---------- CATEGORIES ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "APD" }

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?search=ap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- INVENTORIES ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarung Tangan Safety",
  "unit": "pcs",
  "type": "CONSUMABLE",
  "description": "Sarung tangan kain untuk pekerjaan umum",
  "category_id": 1,
  "site_id": 1,
  "quantity": 50
}

### Barang yang sama di site lain = baris baru, SKU otomatis berbeda (MEGS-POMS-SM-001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarung Tangan Safety",
  "unit": "pcs",
  "type": "CONSUMABLE",
  "category_id": 1,
  "site_id": 2,
  "quantity": 20
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories?search=sarung&site_id=1&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter berdasarkan jenis barang
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories?type=NON_CONSUMABLE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cari lewat SKU (huruf kecil juga bisa)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/sku/megs-gmg-sm-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/inventories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarung Tangan Safety",
  "unit": "pasang",
  "type": "CONSUMABLE",
  "description": null,
  "category_id": 1,
  "site_id": 1
}

### ---------- Uji error yang diharapkan ----------
### Kategori masih dipakai barang → 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### category_id tidak ada → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Uji", "unit": "pcs", "type": "CONSUMABLE", "category_id": 999, "site_id": 1 }

### type tidak valid → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Uji", "unit": "pcs", "type": "SEKALI_PAKAI", "category_id": 1, "site_id": 1 }

### Nama barang sudah ada di site yang sama → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "sarung tangan safety", "unit": "pcs", "type": "CONSUMABLE", "category_id": 1, "site_id": 1 }

### Mengirim sku manual → 400 (SKU dibuat otomatis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Masker", "unit": "pcs", "type": "CONSUMABLE", "category_id": 1, "site_id": 1, "sku": "ABC-1" }

### Ubah quantity lewat PUT → 400 (harus lewat stock movement)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/inventories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sarung Tangan Safety", "unit": "pcs", "type": "CONSUMABLE", "category_id": 1, "site_id": 1, "quantity": 999 }

### Tanpa token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
